  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Institutions and Capacity of the Ministry of Agriculture  State Veterinary Inspection Service for Policy Formulation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance the capacities of the Government to implement the Agrarian Reform and support the development of the agriculture and rural sector with specific focus on the formulation and implementation of inclusive and effective agriculture and food security policy processes. Improve platforms and institutions supportive to private public parnership in sector of provision of veterinary services.</narrative>
